cff-version: 1.2.0

message: >
  This repository contains the engineering artefacts supporting CRISP-TAI,
  the first instantiation of the Lifecycle Refinement Framework over the
  CRISP-DM lifecycle. Version 0.2.0 is aligned with the revised version of
  the associated research article. If you use these artefacts, please cite
  the associated research article.

title: "CRISP-TAI Engineering Artefacts"

version: "0.2.0"

